    <guid isPermaLink="false">6772aaec1e823e72d3f8f870</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Dec 2024 14:38:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：DU老师&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>他最近做了一件很疯的事情，告别自己11的工作去追寻他的梦想了……我也蛮震惊，下面请听他讲述关于他和他的苏州往事～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">08:21</a> 我为甚么选择留在苏州</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 我的11年见证了地产行业的辉煌与平静</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 我眼中的苏州</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a>苏州人的早餐吃什么以及苏州有什么好吃的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a> 外星人来苏州应该怎么玩儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4382">01:13:02</a> “我”的2024和“我”的2025</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>《准时下班》提前祝大家元旦快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>再见2024！</span></p><span></span><p><span>你好2025！</span></p>]]></description>
