  <item>
    <title>007.【播客体验计划04】异乡人：我在成都挺好的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650683bd968755797180a16b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650683bd968755797180a16b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Sep 2023 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播的话】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>“不知不觉把他乡，当做了故乡……”在节目里出现很多次的孙老师终于来上节目了！他从体制内辞职，考研，再次毕业，实习，就业……将工作地点选在了成都。他喜欢喝酒、喜欢机车更喜欢自由～曾经叱诧风云的孙老师都经历了哪些故事呢？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsaAIf0sWmW6za3gXZUhv1XH4mPS.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmhfZFQd-CeIzjAAB1nnAdldg-US.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【企划：播客体验计划】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>邀请没有录过播客的朋友过来分享人生故事，体验播客录制的整个过程。你可能会紧张、会害怕、会不自信……不过没关系，不是期末考试，激情开麦，相信自己！</span><strong><span>故事投稿📮：2900391745@qq.com</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【声音目录】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第一部分 </span><strong><span>张老师</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 孙老师有了新室友：张老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> 甜蜜蜜1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 羔子去相亲了？鹅老师介绍的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a> 探店成都新酒吧：夜鹃Chinese Room</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> 甜蜜蜜2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> “彩蛋”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> </span><strong><span>答应送给旺旺的【帆布包】孙老师什么时候兑现？！！（咒骂）</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第二部分 </span><strong><span>从体制内辞职去读研</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 孙老师竟然研究起了他讨厌的专业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1839">30:39</a> 孙老师学的啥专业？GIS又是啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2132">35:32</a> 背着家里就从体制内辞职考研去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">41:38</a> 放弃南京的研究所而选择了新疆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2758">45:58</a> 孙老师在读研期间是如何攒钱的？还买了一辆摩托车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">50:10</a> 大老板不管，小老板能力不足，孙老师如何靠自己卷到了他的同门师兄？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3730">01:02:10</a> 在学校使用的银行卡突然多了500块钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3921">01:05:21</a> 25岁生日礼物</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrbAk72cnoAJVorxsR2AesqRsZc1.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrCuW9hBlo7aspUIaeNk3taEy9BR.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第三部分 </span><strong><span>骑行、新疆和有趣的朋友</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4057">01:07:37</a> 通过骑行认识了很多新疆本地的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4110">01:08:30</a> 为什么爱机车，为什么爱骑行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4418">01:13:38</a> 雪山下的咖啡馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpP6Mk7ezf3YZBZiccFYMmI9_b22.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4972">01:22:52</a> 大美新疆：一年四季，四季风景各不同</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3c1NCS___Elw6gGW27yWIbIZPf.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第四部分 </span><strong><span>成都</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5449">01:30:49</a> 为什么选择成都？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5570">01:32:50</a> 成都的初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5665">01:34:25</a> 在成都如何过冬？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5717">01:35:17</a> 在成都水果坏的很快</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5901">01:38:21</a> 有夜生活的成都</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6227">01:43:47</a> 登上米其林的芙蓉凰，到底好不好吃？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6387">01:46:27</a> 孙老师已经打卡40多家酒吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6450">01:47:30</a> 安利酒吧：跳海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7063">01:57:43</a> 孙老师工作步入正轨，压力山大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7380">02:03:00</a> 本以为鹅老师很高冷，没想到私下却很暖心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7440">02:04:00</a> 情绪控制很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7546">02:05:46</a> 去了这么多城市，还是最爱成都</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7932">02:12:12</a> 甜蜜蜜3</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8628">02:23:48</a> 由于长时间录制，张老师给孙老师写了小作文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8652">02:24:12</a> 既然选择了，就不后悔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8806">02:26:46</a> 想带上你私奔，去做最幸福的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐合辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>橘子海、椅子乐团 The Chairs - 一次成像</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chris James - 29</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nathan Evans - Wellerman</span></p><span></span><p><span>梁博 - 私奔 (Live)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>2900391745@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsdZ8fQrhebGfT-Sy4NCS7iJ7V1v.m4a" length="214908028" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:28:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z2c1BZQkNvd1liaFVSRnI2bVBFcVVCdlZ2XzgucG5n.png"/>
