  <item>
    <title>【播客体验计划01】现实像个石头，精神像个蛋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64cf2b9f80c9ec4c5f802979</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64cf2b9f80c9ec4c5f802979</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Aug 2023 05:11:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播的话】</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈喽，大家好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>“再见分别” 又像昨天。生命的不期而遇，总是让人惊喜而留恋。时隔一年，我们的播客又再次更新了！接触</span><strong><span>播客</span></strong><span>以来遇到很多有趣的朋友，琢磨着有趣的东西就应该被记录。今日再出发，准备的还是不足，犹豫再三，不如直接开整，会有很多瑕疵，大家尽管在评论区开喷吧！「小声：我们是一档与听众共同成长的养成系播客」</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【播客体验计划】企划</span></h2><span></span><p><span>邀请身边没有录过播客的朋友过来体验录制播客整个的过程。你可能会紧张、会害怕、会不自信……不过没关系，不是期末考试，请激情开麦，相信自己！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【特别鸣谢】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>器材、技术支持：小严、秀杰哥、wanying【2021播客制作手册】、杨一【NPR播客入门指南】、播客《GQ实验室》决策分群</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>可爱的大红姐👩🏻‍🦰</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期声音目录】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>在摇滚里追寻着“你”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">22:14</a> 介绍作家安庆和其作品：《遍地青麻》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%89%E5%BA%86/62418034?fr=ge_ala" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%89%E5%BA%86/62418034?fr=ge_ala"><span>百度百科：作家 安庆</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://weread.qq.com/book-detail?type=1&amp;senderVid=72697269&amp;v=5c532e1071b08af75c5a2a7" data-url="https://weread.qq.com/book-detail?type=1&amp;senderVid=72697269&amp;v=5c532e1071b08af75c5a2a7"><span>作品《遍地青麻》在线阅读</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a>大红姐：人生的新体验录播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>四、节目预告：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64c4a56db3f6c440a854e1d3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64c4a56db3f6c440a854e1d3"><span>《和作家安庆读书》</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkK-MY8Zd8Um80ivGuj9sixKLF8M.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【音乐合集】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>反光镜 -《嘿，姑娘》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>崔健 -《新长征路上的摇滚》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>痛仰乐队 -《为你唱首歌》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>零点乐队 -《相信自己》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
