    <title>000.欢迎光临｜今天的你，准时下班了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62f5bcb6226f5c1fa0d586b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62f5bcb6226f5c1fa0d586b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Aug 2022 02:36:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，大家好！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在一顿意大利聚餐后，我们迎来了《准时下班》的第0期播客。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>这是一档由回到小镇的两位做题家创立的播客，致力于传播快乐，打发无聊的下班时间。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第0期播客，由于我们是在外面边吃饭边录制，爆音有点严重，烦请各路神仙多担待，大家能感受的我们欢乐的气氛就好，大家有什么尽管说，我们评论区见。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期使用到的音乐】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>The Chairs - Aphrodite &nbsp;椅子乐团</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Coffee's On Me &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;落日飞车</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>笨蛋的holiday &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;TangoZ</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
